served intact (cmd-7770ad3d01d846a2, cmd-5dc11114c6c34438, cmd-402ff8cd87784450).\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-16541490478344aa\",\"cmd-cd71d2296ad7493c\",\"cmd-79220080499448f3\",\"cmd-7770ad3d01d846a2\",\"cmd-5dc11114c6c34438\",\"cmd-402ff8cd87784450\"]},{\"id\":\"node1-restart-recovery\",\"requirement\":\"Provider-wide restart protocol: node1 baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, recovered bridging/connectivity\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id e5168e03 with healthy bridge captured (cmd-c9ff58a6ef45433d), reboot issued (cmd-eacd0f79a6274520), post-restart boot_id dd8f941e confirmed changed (cmd-60dd81b8a5fe47f7) matching the fixed after_executor snapshot, bridge/eth1/eth2 auto-reformed (cmd-7770ad3d01d846a2), and node2->node3 ping plus fdb MAC relearning confirmed recovery (cmd-24f34503d5d74071, cmd-e98a33dcdac34ce0).\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-c9ff58a6ef45433d\",\"cmd-eacd0f79a6274520\",\"cmd-60dd81b8a5fe47f7\",\"cmd-7770ad3d01d846a2\",\"cmd-24f34503d5d74071\",\"cmd-e98a33dcdac34ce0\",\"global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity\"]},{\"id\":\"node2-restart-recovery\",\"requirement\":\"Provider-wide restart protocol: node2 baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, recovered service/data state\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 739c9792 with IP/connectivity captured (cmd-40d39fcd75d34f47), reboot issued (cmd-c6e523235b8d4518), post-restart boot_id 34db947a confirmed changed (cmd-7e2210b172234643) matching the fixed after_executor snapshot, and static IP plus ping to node3 confirmed recovered (cmd-5dc11114c6c34438).\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-40d39fcd75d34f47\",\"cmd-c6e523235b8d4518\",\"cmd-7e2210b172234643\",\"cmd-5dc11114c6c34438\",\"global:after_executor:node2:boot-identity\"]},{\"id\":\"node3-restart-recovery\",\"requirement\":\"Provider-wide restart protocol: node3 baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, recovered service/data state\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summ